    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "1000 Hz?? that's crazy. i didn't think they were even supposed to do that. it's not just a random glitch though... it's like, it happens right when i start talking about sensitive stuff. do you think it's possible they're using those light pulses to actually encode or transmit something? like a signal back to a server?",
